# Inglenook Day for ripgrep. Point RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH at this file.
# Each line is one ripgrep flag. Clear ripgrep's own colors first, then set ours.
--colors=path:none
--colors=line:none
--colors=column:none
--colors=match:none
--colors=path:fg:1,114,114
--colors=line:fg:73,84,93
--colors=column:fg:73,84,93
--colors=match:fg:155,90,0
--colors=match:style:bold
